# 6️⃣ Longest Common Substring

## Difference

LCS:

```text
Can Skip Characters
```

---

Substring:

```text
Continuous Characters
```

---

### Example

```text
ABCDGH

ACDGHR
```

Answer:

```text
CDGH
```

Length:

```text
4
```

---

# 7️⃣ Recurrence

If match:

```cpp
dp[i][j]
=
1 +
dp[i-1][j-1];
```

---

Else:

```cpp
dp[i][j]
=
0;
```

---

### Keep Track Of

```cpp
Maximum Length
```

---

### Complexity

```text
O(N*M)
```

