# 1️⃣3️⃣ Edit Distance

## Problem

Convert:

```text
Word1
```

into:

```text
Word2
```

Operations:

```text
Insert

Delete

Replace
```

---

### Example

```text
horse

↓

ros
```

Answer:

```text
3
```

---

# 1️⃣4️⃣ State

```cpp
dp[i][j]
```

Meaning:

```text
Minimum Operations
to convert

word1[0..i]

to

word2[0..j]
```

---

# 1️⃣5️⃣ Recurrence

If match:

```cpp
dp[i-1][j-1]
```

---

Else:

Take minimum of:

### Insert

```cpp
dp[i][j-1]
```

### Delete

```cpp
dp[i-1][j]
```

### Replace

```cpp
dp[i-1][j-1]
```

Formula:

```cpp
1 +
min(
insert,
delete,
replace
)
```

---

### Complexity

```text
O(N*M)
```

---

# 1️⃣6️⃣ Shortest Common Supersequence

## Problem

Smallest string containing:

```text
Both Strings
```

as subsequences.

---

### Example

```text
abac

cab
```

Answer:

```text
cabac
```

---

# 1️⃣7️⃣ Formula

First find:

```text
LCS
```

