# 💡 Interview Tips

✅ LPS = LCS(String, Reverse).

✅ Minimum Insertions = N - LPS.

✅ Minimum Deletions = N - LPS.

✅ Edit Distance has 3 operations.

✅ LCS is foundation of String DP.

